      "lines": [
        "Context: Emergence of “Recurrent” Connections",
        "• Recurrent connections: an approach to save",
        "information for later use (i.e., memory)",
        "• 1962: discussed in Rosenblatt’s book on perceptrons",
        "• 1982: promising experimental results demonstrated",
        "by John Hopfield (2024 Nobel Prize winner)",
        "• 1986: generalizable learning method",
        "(backpropagation) introduced in Rumelhart paper"
      ]
    },
