        "How to handle when",
        "sequences are predicted?",
        "• Repeat until stopping criterion met:",
        "1. Propagate training data through unfolded network to predict output",
        "2. Measure error of predictions using a loss function",
        "3. Calculate gradients of the loss function to determine how each",
        "model parameter contributed to the error; weight sharing",
        "accounted for by summing gradients across all time steps",
        "4. Update each parameter using calculated gradients"
